cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, naming the dated release (tag vYYYY.MM.DD) you used."
type: dataset
title: "Freeze Ledger: an open, reproducible ledger of stablecoin issuer freezes"
abstract: >-
  Every address Tether and Circle have frozen or unfrozen on Ethereum, Base,
  Tron and Solana, read directly from the chain, with a hashed receipt for
  each row, each freeze joined to the public record that explains it (OFAC
  SDN entry, Federal Register notice, DOJ filing, issuer statement) and graded
  high, moderate or low, or marked unattributed. Verified nightly.
authors:
  - family-names: Percy
    given-names: Jake
repository-code: "https://github.com/jakeperc/freeze-ledger"
url: "https://freeze-ledger.jakepercy.com/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - stablecoin
  - USDT
  - USDC
  - Tether
  - Circle
  - blacklist
  - OFAC
  - sanctions
